  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following statements:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> : I have fever<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> : I will not take medicine<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> : I will take rest<br />The statement &quot;If I have fever, then I will take medicine and I will take rest&quot; is equivalent to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know the conditional statement:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>if</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>then</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is&#160;given&#160;by</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>So the given statements If I have fever, then I will take medicine and I will take rest can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
